invariant: INV-53
file: Makefile
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: proof-reach stops passing REACH_SHARD to proof/coverage.py, so each
  of the three proof-reach jobs measures every harness. Each job then
  passes, and merge-reach-table fails only after hours of runner time.
  lint-matrix reads the recipe of the make target that each sharded step
  runs.

--- old
	python3 -u proof/coverage.py --reach $(if $(REACH_SHARD),--shard=$(REACH_SHARD))
--- new
	python3 -u proof/coverage.py --reach
